Built-in Docker templates

Most templates in this folder were converted from Coolify's one-click service
templates (https://github.com/coollabsio/coolify, templates/compose),
Copyright Coolify contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). They were changed: Coolify's
magic variables were replaced with Morche placeholders, proxy labels were
removed, ports are published, and files are named configs. Each converted file
says so in its first line.

The logos in the frontend's public/apps/templates folder are trademarks of
their owners and are used only to identify the software.
